infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title Granularity: chatty deep nesting vs flatten + expand
  desc One screen needing 8 entities — 640 ms of sequential round-trips, or one ~80 ms call
  compares
    - label Deep nesting (chatty)
      children
        - label 8 sequential round-trips
          desc Render walks customer -> projects -> orders -> items
        - label 640 ms before any rendering
          desc 80 ms per round-trip x 8 — the N+1 problem promoted to the network
        - label Fragile encoded paths
          desc Move an item between orders and every nested URL breaks
        - label /customers/7/projects/3/orders/42/items
          desc Reaching a resource requires its whole ancestry
    - label Flatten + ?expand
      children
        - label 1 round-trip
          desc ?expand=items,customer returns the screen in one call
        - label ~80 ms before any rendering
          desc One coarse representation, no hierarchy walk — 8x faster
        - label Stable root IDs
          desc /orders?customer=7&project=3 — query params for the relationship
        - label Nest at most 1 level (2 max)
          desc Address each resource by its own ID at the root
theme
  palette #f43f5e #14b8a6
